# Custom modules

These are background extensions of existing Odoo apps. They never create a new app.

## Technical names

`int_<app>_customizations`

```
int_inventory_customizations
int_shippo_customizations
int_helpdesk_customizations
int_contacts_customizations
```

Do not use `int_base`, `rvsb_`, or an unprefixed name. Never set `application: True`.

## Manifest

- `name`: `<App> Customizations` (no "Internal" in the display name)
- `author`: `Internal`
- `application`: `False`
- `version`: `19.0.x.y.z`
- `license`: `LGPL-3`
- `depends`: only the upstream Odoo apps being extended (e.g. `stock`, `helpdesk`)

## Layout

```
int_<app>_customizations/
  __init__.py
  __manifest__.py
  models/
  views/
  data/
```

One existing app per module. Do not dump Studio exports as `studio_customization`.
